-- and whether the medium is a chiral environment: some constituent in excess over its mirror image. A
-- constituent is marked in excess only for a substance whose record has no improper symmetry, which is
-- the honesty condition tying this field to the graph.
sol-chiral : Solution → Bool
sol-chiral l = case l of
  nil → false
  cons e r → (case dis-excess e of true → true; false → sol-chiral r)
